# Playwright test plan for LobsterBrowse + Zeolite

Fixed site list. Run every Group A/B/C site through LobsterBrowse (beta, Zeolite
engine) at https://lobsterbrowse-beta-gq13.onrender.com. Run Groups B and C a
second time direct for comparison. One navigation per site unless the steps say
otherwise; a broken site must show exactly 1 navigation (no reload loops).

## Common run procedure (all sites, no exceptions)

Engine run:
1. chromium.launch({headless:true}), context viewport 1280x900, newCDPSession.
2. Emulation.setUserAgentOverride with non-headless userAgentMetadata (brands
   Chromium + Google Chrome; a HeadlessChrome brand is bot-flagged by Akamai).
3. Page.enable; count every Page.frameNavigated whose frame URL starts with the
   app origin (this is the navigation+reload count).
4. page.on("console") and page.on("pageerror") collected per site.
5. page.goto("https://lobsterbrowse-beta-gq13.onrender.com",
   waitUntil domcontentloaded); settle 1.5s.
6. page.fill("#lb-search-input", "<URL>"); page.press("#lb-search-input","Enter").
7. Wait the site-specific settle time; then evaluate PASS criteria inside the
   engine iframe (the frame whose URL starts with the app origin and contains
   /zl/ or /__zl_navh__ or anubis).
8. Record: navigation count, console errors, failed requests, document.cookie
   visibility, screenshot to shots/<n>-lb.png.
9. Status label: PASS, FAIL, BLOCKED-BY-SANDBOX, CHALLENGE, LOGIN-WALL,
   REGION-UNAVAILABLE. Nothing else.

Direct run (Groups B and C only): same browser, page.goto(site URL) directly,
same measurements, screenshot to shots/<n>-direct.png.

Captchas and bot checks: verify the challenge widget loads, renders and reacts
to a click. Never solve it, never complete it, never bypass it. A challenge that
loads and reacts = CHALLENGE status (pass for the render check). Spinning
forever, blank frame, or console errors = FAIL.

AI chat message rule (Groups B and C): send exactly one message "hi" to
claude.ai, chatgpt.com and Google AI Mode. If the service requires login first,
record LOGIN-WALL and stop. Never sign in. Never type anything personal.

